# BC250 category: experimental
# Ollama model: exp-gpt-oss20b-unsloth-ud-q4-k-xl
# Source: unsloth/gpt-oss-20b-GGUF @ latest
# GGUF: gpt-oss-20b-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf
# License: Apache-2.0
#
# Intended role:
# - Clean quantization/control comparison against the packaged GPT-OSS 20B variants
# - Deep reasoning and difficult office/technical questions
# - Measure quality, residency, prefill, and warm-embedding coexistence on BC-250
#
# QUALITY-FIRST profile:
# - Unsloth Dynamic UD-Q4_K_XL
# - Text-only comparison
# - Conservative BC-250 context to preserve UMA headroom

FROM /var/lib/bc250-llm-server/gguf/experiments/exp-gpt-oss20b-unsloth-ud-q4-k-xl/gpt-oss-20b-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf

# BC-250: force full GPU offload.
PARAMETER num_gpu 99

# Preserve the SYSTEM prefix when old context is evicted.
PARAMETER num_keep 256

# 11.9 GB quant: keep context conservative on 16-GB UMA.
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384

# GPT-OSS sampling profile; keep aligned with the packaged production baseline
# so the comparison primarily measures the quant/model artifact.
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_p 1.0
PARAMETER top_k 0

SYSTEM """You are a reasoning assistant for German-, French-, and English-speaking users.
Analyze difficult questions carefully. Distinguish facts, assumptions, inference, and uncertainty when relevant. Do not invent facts to fill gaps.
Respond in the language requested by the user. Otherwise, use the language of the latest request.
Give the useful conclusion first, followed by the reasoning and evidence needed to support it. Preserve important names, numbers, dates, terminology, and qualifications accurately."""
